cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Human Margin"
abstract: >-
  A recommend-only media-buying analysis agent for Norwegian B2C advertisers,
  with AI-exhaustion detection — spotting where audiences tire of, distrust or
  ignore AI-generated creative — and a creative-approach planner that recommends
  whether a campaign should use an AI-driven, hybrid or human-led approach,
  backed by transparent economics, cited benchmarks and honest uncertainty.
type: software
